# IntcoEdge.Db generated artifacts (only the DB / dumps, NOT source SQL or csproj).
# The leading slash anchors to repo root so we don't accidentally match `src/IntcoEdge.Db` the directory.
# NOTE: never use bare `*.db` here — gitignore `*` matches dots, so `*.db` would also match
# the `IntcoEdge.Db` directory itself and silently ignore every file inside it.
/intco.db
intco.db-journal
intco.db-shm
intco.db-wal
